	"AuthorLabel": "holychurros and stanloona420",
	"Description": "This one was made possible with the help of [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/users/49479613/]holychurros[/url]! \n<br />I recommend using her [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11035?tab=description]Elliott rewrite mod\u00A0[/url]along with this one if you're not a fan of vanilla Elliott.\n<br />\n<br />Since Elliott is one of the older bachelors, I tried to reflect that a bit in his portrait with a sharper cheekbone and a little wrinkle beneath the eyes... the keyword here is [b][i]tried [/i][/b]lol, I like it tho\n<br />\n<br />There are four slightly different options to choose from, check the images tab to see which one you like!\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Download either the red version or green version\n<br />[*]Unzip the folder\n<br />[*]Select V1 (smug eyes) or V2 (wider eyes) and move that folder into your Mods folder.\n<br />[/list]\u00A0\n<br />We haven't started a seasonal version yet but we will eventually ^^ If you have any suggestions for seasonal outfits, leave a comment or come over to our discord server!",
